      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom home ideally situated close to the Six Cross Roads roundabout, offering quick and convenient access to University Hospital Waterford, Waterford Institute of Technology, the surrounding industrial estates, the M9 motorway and the N25.\r\n\r\nNo. 62 Poplar Drive, Carraig An Áird is presented in excellent condition throughout and benefits from a double-parking space to the front and side access to the rear garden. The beautifully landscaped rear garden features two attractive patio areas, one of which benefits from a covered seating area, creating an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys a pleasant outlook over a green area to the front, while a creche and childcare facility are conveniently located within the development.\r\nThe bright and spacious accommodation extends to approximately 130M² and comprises an entrance hall, guest WC, sitting room and kitchen/dining room at ground-floor level. \r\n\r\nThe first floor accommodates three spacious bedrooms, together with the family bathroom. The second floor is dedicated to the spacious principal bedroom, complete with an ensuite bathroom and additional storage.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from gas-fired central heating and an excellent C1 BER rating.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, an attractive setting and a highly convenient location, No. 62 Poplar Drive would make an excellent family home or investment opportunity. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
